        "id": 1149889
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-04-20T15:26:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree, this style doesnt suit x86 as it is for cortex.\n\nI tried to define IDT statically - however two attributes in the descriptor that seems dynamic.\na. The cs register value, which (though it stays constant) needs to be determined at run time\nb. The the address of default_int_handler function, which could probably be determined looking up the symbol table?\n\nI removed the vectors, instead initialized IDT setting all vectors to default_int_handler. System exceptions will be handled by panic handler from there.",
      "parentUuid": "cbd7567d_dfe5ff51",
      "revId": "302f205e1f6a8ba4c64dadab65895bd6f9974cae",
